{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261016/photo/bkn-20261016103538309-1016_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261016125334\"/><p>大浪灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗。</p><p>康樂及文化事務署今日（10月16日）宣布，由於大浪關係，港島南區的赤柱正灘泳灘、石澳泳灘及大浪灣泳灘；以及西貢區的銀線灣泳灘及清水灣第二灣泳灘已懸掛紅旗，顯示在該5處游泳會有危險，市民請勿在該5處游泳。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T04:59:07.193507+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T02:35:38+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T06:38:20.003785+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T04:57:50.720859+00:00","content_hash":"5469bfaa5b5dc57a80f72a3e061b653da002b199db42c6288d12db5db9729502","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}